span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，经营支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，对附属单位补助支出XX万元。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（五）一般公共预算工资福利支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，商品和服务支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，对个人和家庭的补助</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，资本性支出（基本建设）支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，资本性支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，对企业补贴（基本建设）</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，对企业补贴</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，债务利息及费用支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，其他支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（六）&nbsp;&#8220;三公&#8221;经费一般公共预算财政拨款支出</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元，其中：因公出国（境）费</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元；公务用车购置及运行维护费</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元；公务接待费</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >XX</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >万元。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >二、有关工作要求</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（一）本批复文件作为你部门对预算执行有关事项进行调整的依据，调整事项涉及会计处理的应当遵循政府会计准则制度的规定。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（二）基本建设项目竣工决算审批按现行制度管理，以竣工决算批复数据为准；年度基本建设资金收入支出及结转结余资金不作为基本建设项目竣工决算审批的依据。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（三）你部门应加强对下属单位财务管理的指导和监督，开展账表一致性核查，确保部门决算数据真实、准确、完整。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（四）你部门应当自本批复决算之日起十五日内，依据本批复文件向所属单位批复决算。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DNewStyle43  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（五）请你部门依法依规履行公开责任和义务，做好本部门决算公开工作，并严格按照保密法律法规和《福建省财政厅关于印发福建省预决算公开操作规程的通知》（闽财</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >预〔2017〕38号）等有关规定,建立健全信息公开保密审查机制，做好涉密事项的定密、解密及信息公开的保密审查工作。除涉密部门及依法确定为涉密范围外,应在中国平潭网（网址：</span><span><a href=3D"http://www.pingtan.gov.cn）《政务公开专栏》的\“财政资金\”专栏目录下\“部门决算公开\”统一平台上公开本部门2019年度部门决算及\“三公\”经费决算（具体公开格式详见附件2），为落实省厅鼓励部门决算原则上在同一天集中公开的要求，应提前做好公开文档编辑、网络调试等各项准备工作，统一于8月10日当天公开部门决算，并及时将决算公开情况反馈我局。" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >www.pingtan.gov.cn</span><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >）《政务公开专栏》的&#8220;财政资金&#8221;专栏目录下&#8220;部门决算公开&#8221;统一平台上公开本部门2019年度部门决算及&#8220;三公&#8221;经费决算（具体公开格式详见附件2）;为落实省厅鼓励部门决算原则上在同一天集中公开的要求，应提前做好公开文档编辑、网络调试等各项准备工作，统一于2020年8月20日当天公开部门决算，并及时将决算公开情况反馈我局。</span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DNewStyle43  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >（六）请你部门要结合2019年部门决算量化评价表情况，查问题找差距，进一步加强财务管理，改进预算编制，规范预算执行和会计核算，提高预算绩效管理水平。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >附件：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.2019年部门决算批复表</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2019年部门决算量化评价表</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:80.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:5.0000;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;line-height:28.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span 